      "text": "int ans = a[0], location = 1;\n\nfor(int i = 1; i < n; i++)\n{\n    if(a[i] < ans)\n    {\n        ans = a[i];\n        location = i + 1;\n    }\n}\n\ncout << ans << \" \" << location <<  endl;",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int ans = a[0], location = 1;\n\nfor(int i = 1; i < n; i++)\n{\n    if(a[i] < ans)\n    {\n        ans = a[i];\n        location = i + 1;\n    }\n}\n\ncout << ans << \" \" << location <<  endl;",
